{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09219","headline":"荅王郎中 · 韦应物","name":"荅王郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卧阁枉芳藻，览旨怅秋晨。\n守郡犹羁寓，无以慰嘉宾。\n野旷归云尽，天清晓露新。\n池荷凉已至，牕梧落渐频。\n风物殊京国，邑里但荒榛。\n赋繁属军兴，政拙媿斯人。\n髦士久台阁，中路一漂沦。\n归当列盛朝，岂念卧淮滨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}